WEBVTT

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling, open up your eyes!

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling me wo akete

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
It is in this world's evil den

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
Kono yo no aku no soukutsu de

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
You shall receive a rare heart

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
Tsuibamareru kokoro hoshikute

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Escaping is impossible

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Nige mo dekinu

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
My imprisoned, pale-faced prince

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
Yuuhei no souhaku no ouji yo

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
I am a goddess

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
Watashi ga megami

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Kami-chama Karin

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Mini-Goddess Karin

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
In this ward, you have to poach everything

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
Subete wa mitsuryouku

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
With a hidden snare

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
Usumoreta wana ni

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
If you entrap them

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
Hamerareru no nara

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
You'll want to destroy them too…

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
Konagona ni kudaite hoshii wa

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
To die from natural causes or imcompetence

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
Shi ni itaranu yamai

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
It's all poison to your heart

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
Shinzou ni ha pawazon

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
A rose melting in the flames of purgatory

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
Rengoku no homura de zero kara

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Let's redeem this world…

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Saisei shimashou

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
A black dahlia in the nightless city's sky

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
Fuyoru no sora de kuroi daria

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
A lost delusion, a falling reality

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
Shisuru mousou ochiru genjitsu

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Struggling in hell like an ant

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Mogake ari jigoku

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling, give me your voice!

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling koe agete

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
For right now, our limits will have to change

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
Kono ima sashichigaeru hodo

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
If we want for the most important thing

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
Daiji na mono ga hoshii no nara

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Discover the result of your prayers

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Inori wa hatete

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Your princess is dying in prison

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Rougoku de shouten no himegimi

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
You are such a devil…

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
Anata ga maou

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Hate's fist and grief's wounds, too

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Ikari no ken mo nageki no kizu mo

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Dissolving, vanishing, unraveling, passing away, without a trace

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Atokata mo naku tokete kiete chitte utakata

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:35.100
The Beach

00:01:36.380 --> 00:01:40.220
When talking about the biggest event in summer…

00:01:42.430 --> 00:01:44.480
IT'S THE SEA! {no-no, umi - sea!}

00:01:44.480 --> 00:01:47.770
Ah, I'm already enjoying myself to the fullest!

00:01:48.730 --> 00:01:50.730
When talking about the sea…

00:01:52.150 --> 00:01:54.030
you have to do beach volleyball, right?

00:01:56.320 --> 00:01:59.320
Coach, I can't stand up anymore!

00:01:59.660 --> 00:02:01.120
Come, stand.

00:02:02.620 --> 00:02:03.660
Coach.

00:02:04.080 --> 00:02:04.830
Stand.

00:02:05.330 --> 00:02:07.500
Give me your toss of love!

00:02:08.750 --> 00:02:14.960
I'll attack your heart with that love.

00:02:16.220 --> 00:02:18.590
After that comes surfing.

00:02:19.510 --> 00:02:23.060
And then, no matter what, you have to have the sunset meeting.

00:02:23.180 --> 00:02:24.430
Karin!!!

00:02:25.060 --> 00:02:26.940
Try to catch me!

00:02:28.650 --> 00:02:29.770
Why you!

00:02:29.770 --> 00:02:32.070
Ah, you caught me!

00:02:32.610 --> 00:02:33.480
Karin.

00:02:35.110 --> 00:02:37.280
What?!

00:02:38.490 --> 00:02:39.780
What's with you all of a sudden?

00:02:40.070 --> 00:02:43.120
Kazune-kun! Why are you here?

00:02:43.120 --> 00:02:45.660
We've been together since we left this morning!

00:02:46.910 --> 00:02:50.380
You seemed really happy just now, Hanazono-san.

00:02:50.750 --> 00:02:54.840
Karin-chan, is something the matter?

00:02:54.840 --> 00:02:56.550
It's nothing! It's nothing!

00:02:56.550 --> 00:02:58.720
It's really nothing.

00:02:58.720 --> 00:03:00.550
Come on, let's swim!

00:03:01.890 --> 00:03:06.020
Karin-chan, you can't.

00:03:07.100 --> 00:03:10.940
Did she figure out what I was imagining?

00:03:11.520 --> 00:03:16.900
You have to do warm-up exercises before you swim!

00:03:18.190 --> 00:03:19.860
Oh yeah, of course!

00:03:27.290 --> 00:03:31.290
I'm sorry, for overcrowding your family's holiday house.

00:03:31.290 --> 00:03:34.460
My grandmother told me to use it however I wanted to.

00:03:34.960 --> 00:03:36.000
So, don't worry about it.

00:03:38.210 --> 00:03:41.010
That swimsuit really suits Hanazono-san.

00:03:42.050 --> 00:03:44.470
Isn't it just normal?

00:03:47.520 --> 00:03:49.520
I found you, amateur goddess.

00:03:50.100 --> 00:03:53.100
Having a vacation on the sea, how carefree.

00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:56.230
This is the ideal chance to steal your ring.

00:03:56.230 --> 00:03:57.070
Nii-san.

00:03:57.780 --> 00:03:59.150
I'm against this.

00:03:59.860 --> 00:04:02.030
If you don't like it, you don't have to come.

00:04:02.660 --> 00:04:05.910
The summer sea isn't a place to fight.

00:04:06.700 --> 00:04:09.540
Isn't it a place to make fun memories?

00:04:10.370 --> 00:04:12.120
Fun memories?

00:04:12.580 --> 00:04:14.130
That's fine and dandy, but…

00:04:14.130 --> 00:04:16.780
Kirika... how many fun memories are you planning to make?

00:04:16.780 --> 00:04:19.210
Kirika... how many fun memories are you planning to make?

00:04:20.300 --> 00:04:22.380
This is just in case we need any of it.

00:04:22.840 --> 00:04:24.340
What do you mean "just in case"?

00:04:24.840 --> 00:04:28.770
But, it's great that you brought this along.

00:04:30.060 --> 00:04:33.520
Hey, you two!

00:04:33.520 --> 00:04:36.400
Come over here!

00:04:38.520 --> 00:04:40.570
Aren't you going to swim, Nishikiyori?

00:04:41.030 --> 00:04:42.820
Nope, I guess not.

00:04:46.620 --> 00:04:49.540
I love the sea, and it's fun, but…

00:04:49.540 --> 00:04:52.750
I had a fight with the Goddess of the Beach. {yes, Nagisa - beach}

00:04:52.750 --> 00:04:55.380
And I can no longer accept the water.

00:04:55.580 --> 00:04:58.210
In other words, you can't swim.

00:04:58.710 --> 00:05:01.010
What about you? Aren't you going to swim?

00:05:01.670 --> 00:05:04.300
I don't want to get sunburned.

00:05:04.720 --> 00:05:06.680
I turn red real easily.

00:05:07.350 --> 00:05:08.720
Well then.

00:05:09.390 --> 00:05:11.180
What about you swim wearing this?

00:05:11.180 --> 00:05:12.100
It's my granny's.

00:05:13.270 --> 00:05:14.890
As if I'd wear that!

00:05:14.890 --> 00:05:17.230
I wonder if they're going to swim.

00:05:17.400 --> 00:05:21.190
But it seems like they're having fun.

00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:33.870
It seems she hasn't noticed me.

00:05:34.830 --> 00:05:38.130
I'll take this chance to get that ring, with this item.

00:05:49.510 --> 00:05:50.100
A chance!

00:05:52.140 --> 00:05:53.060
I got it!

00:05:54.560 --> 00:05:57.350
No!!!

00:05:58.100 --> 00:06:02.070
What's wrong, Karin-chan?

00:06:02.070 --> 00:06:03.820
It's gone, gone, gone, gone!

00:06:03.820 --> 00:06:04.400
Karin!

00:06:04.400 --> 00:06:07.030
Battle Transformation, using Hades' Power!

00:06:12.700 --> 00:06:14.200
Beachy glasses guy!

00:06:14.200 --> 00:06:16.870
Shut up, I'm not "beachy glasses guy".

00:06:16.870 --> 00:06:18.250
I'm Karasuma Kirio.

00:06:18.250 --> 00:06:19.420
Karin!

00:06:19.540 --> 00:06:20.540
Kazune-kun!

00:06:21.090 --> 00:06:23.500
The ultra-violet rays are dangerous during summer.

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:25.550
You'll be guarded perfectly if you wear this.

00:06:26.130 --> 00:06:27.800
I don't have the time for this.

00:06:28.180 --> 00:06:30.050
You have to wear it.

00:06:30.050 --> 00:06:31.510
What's that outfit?

00:06:32.220 --> 00:06:36.020
How are you thinking of defeating beachy glasses guy?

00:06:36.390 --> 00:06:38.520
Get out of the way, amateur goddess.

00:06:40.230 --> 00:06:42.070
Karin-chan.

00:06:42.070 --> 00:06:43.520
At a time like this…

00:06:43.940 --> 00:06:47.320
If you don't move, I won't go easy on you.

00:06:47.900 --> 00:06:48.740
I am-

00:06:50.110 --> 00:06:53.240
Fool! You cannot transform.

00:06:53.410 --> 00:06:55.290
God!!!

00:06:57.710 --> 00:06:58.370
What?

00:07:10.050 --> 00:07:11.260
She transformed…

00:07:11.590 --> 00:07:13.260
This is impossible.

00:07:13.560 --> 00:07:16.470
God Thunder!

00:07:33.200 --> 00:07:34.120
Karin!

00:07:34.240 --> 00:07:34.870
Himeka!

00:07:35.620 --> 00:07:36.450
Are you okay?

00:07:36.830 --> 00:07:39.960
Yes, we're fine.

00:07:40.160 --> 00:07:42.080
I see, you did well.

00:07:46.050 --> 00:07:47.260
Karin, what's wro-

00:07:47.300 --> 00:07:48.840
Don't get close!

00:07:49.380 --> 00:07:50.800
W-Why?

00:07:51.510 --> 00:07:52.970
Everyone!

00:07:54.100 --> 00:07:55.680
I'm coming now!

00:08:00.230 --> 00:08:02.900
Nii-san, that was the worst way of trying to get it.

00:08:02.900 --> 00:08:05.730
Be silent, it was a perfect plan.

00:08:06.860 --> 00:08:08.480
But, how?

00:08:08.480 --> 00:08:11.910
How was the amateur goddess able to transform without her ring?

00:08:12.240 --> 00:08:14.200
I should have stolen it!

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:16.330
The ring is definit-

00:08:18.540 --> 00:08:20.290
Bikini!

00:08:20.870 --> 00:08:22.290
You're the worst.

00:08:34.840 --> 00:08:37.100
I got kind of carried away.

00:08:37.720 --> 00:08:39.930
Forgive me, Kirika.

00:08:40.310 --> 00:08:41.600
Tell me about it.

00:08:43.600 --> 00:08:45.610
This is bad.

00:08:46.060 --> 00:08:47.860
Karin-chan.

00:08:48.320 --> 00:08:50.570
Even though we finally came to the sea…

00:08:50.570 --> 00:08:52.820
I can't swim like this.

00:08:53.280 --> 00:08:57.410
Hey, I've got a good idea.

00:08:57.780 --> 00:08:58.660
Really?

00:09:01.870 --> 00:09:04.830
Um… this might be a little…

00:09:08.840 --> 00:09:11.840
It's sexy!

00:09:12.090 --> 00:09:14.470
R-Really?

00:09:15.300 --> 00:09:17.220
Geez, Kazune-kun!

00:09:18.890 --> 00:09:20.010
That's not it.

00:09:21.100 --> 00:09:23.430
Won't you get cold in that?

00:09:28.440 --> 00:09:30.360
Kazune-chan.

00:09:32.150 --> 00:09:33.740
No, well…

00:09:34.860 --> 00:09:36.990
Did you say they were flat?!

00:09:36.990 --> 00:09:41.080
Do you have some problem with me putting them away?

00:09:41.370 --> 00:09:43.080
Take this, and this!

00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:45.040
Hey, everyone!

00:09:45.290 --> 00:09:46.750
There are swimsuits over there.

00:09:48.720 --> 00:09:49.710
Is it grilled
eel over rice?

00:09:50.790 --> 00:09:53.250
I am God!

00:09:56.960 --> 00:09:58.210
You moron.

00:09:57.190 --> 00:09:58.210
It's a croquette!

00:10:00.470 --> 00:10:03.220
Now we'll bring out the Venus of Men.

00:10:03.390 --> 00:10:06.060
The once in a lifetime heart-beating idol…

00:10:06.060 --> 00:10:08.350
Kuga Jin's Challenge TV!

00:10:08.610 --> 00:10:11.730
- Today, at the beach we're going…

00:10:10.570 --> 00:10:13.280
- I get the feeling I've seen that guy before…

00:10:13.650 --> 00:10:18.280
The lead actor is of course, this guy, Kuga Jin!

00:10:20.030 --> 00:10:22.950
I love you all! Let's rendezvous on the beach!

00:10:26.830 --> 00:10:31.090
What does this have to do with my bikini?

00:10:31.090 --> 00:10:32.670
Look at that.

00:10:33.090 --> 00:10:35.470
The winner will get a trip to a hot spring.

00:10:35.800 --> 00:10:38.090
Second place will get a selection of seafood.

00:10:38.430 --> 00:10:41.640
Even third place will get a pair of swimsuits.

00:10:41.640 --> 00:10:43.680
Isn't this program generous?!

00:10:44.220 --> 00:10:45.180
A swimsuit!

00:10:45.480 --> 00:10:48.770
See, if you get third place you'll get a swimsuit!

00:10:49.190 --> 00:10:51.230
Well then, do we have any challenging pairs?!

00:10:51.230 --> 00:10:51.770
Here!

00:10:52.150 --> 00:10:54.440
Okay, that energetic girl over there!

00:10:54.440 --> 00:10:57.320
Well then, come up here with that boyfriend next to you.

00:10:57.530 --> 00:10:58.030
Huh?

00:10:58.610 --> 00:10:59.450
Me?

00:11:00.030 --> 00:11:03.030
He's not my boyfriend…

00:11:03.280 --> 00:11:06.500
The amateur goddess is participating in this event.

00:11:06.500 --> 00:11:09.960
In this confusion, this time we'll steal the ring.

00:11:09.960 --> 00:11:11.580
Nii-san, stop it already.

00:11:11.920 --> 00:11:13.550
Okay, one more team.

00:11:13.550 --> 00:11:14.420
Here.

00:11:18.170 --> 00:11:20.180
Alright, what's your name?

00:11:20.890 --> 00:11:22.760
It's Hanazono Karin.

00:11:23.010 --> 00:11:24.810
Kujyou Kazune.

00:11:24.970 --> 00:11:27.680
You're sure a nice couple.

00:11:27.680 --> 00:11:29.100
T-That's…

00:11:29.480 --> 00:11:31.810
And over here…

00:11:32.190 --> 00:11:33.480
What's your name?

00:11:33.480 --> 00:11:34.650
Ichibanboshi

00:11:33.480 --> 00:11:36.900
<u>Which means:</u> First Star of the Night

00:11:36.900 --> 00:11:38.700
Ah, it's Nagisa no Ichibanboshi.

00:11:40.530 --> 00:11:42.120
What about you?

00:11:42.870 --> 00:11:44.870
Similarly, Nibanboshi!

00:11:42.870 --> 00:11:45.870
<u>Which means:</u> Second Star of the Night

00:11:45.290 --> 00:11:48.710
This is the first time we've ever had a pair of bears on this show!

00:11:49.160 --> 00:11:51.790
Nii-san, why are we dressed like this?

00:11:51.790 --> 00:11:53.710
It'd be bad if they recognized our faces.

00:11:54.090 --> 00:11:56.460
Well then, let's start the challenge.

00:11:56.670 --> 00:11:58.380
The theme is "Curry".

00:11:58.380 --> 00:12:01.470
We don't mind how many ingredients you use.

00:12:01.800 --> 00:12:03.800
Well then, get ready…

00:12:04.140 --> 00:12:05.100
Start!

00:12:09.350 --> 00:12:11.270
That's an amazing kitchen knife skill!

00:12:11.690 --> 00:12:12.690
He's fast!

00:12:12.980 --> 00:12:17.690
In our current age, ones who can't make something delicious are failures as men.

00:12:17.980 --> 00:12:19.240
What was that?

00:12:19.570 --> 00:12:22.360
As if I'd lose!

00:12:23.030 --> 00:12:25.410
Kazune-kun, what do you want me to do?

00:12:25.410 --> 00:12:28.490
Stay out of the way, this is a fight between men!

00:12:29.120 --> 00:12:31.210
Then there's no point in being a pair, is there?

00:12:34.920 --> 00:12:38.710
With such dangerous cutting, you might cut your girlfriend.

00:12:39.050 --> 00:12:40.340
Put a sock in it.

00:12:42.720 --> 00:12:43.220
You…

00:12:44.970 --> 00:12:47.560
That's chikuwa, right?

00:12:48.140 --> 00:12:49.720
What's wrong with that?

00:12:50.020 --> 00:12:51.310
What about the meat?

00:12:51.940 --> 00:12:52.600
Meat?

00:12:56.230 --> 00:12:58.980
You, don't tell me you…

00:13:01.820 --> 00:13:03.950
…you're going to use meat in your curry?

00:13:05.660 --> 00:13:07.830
Meat's a high class ingredient!

00:13:07.830 --> 00:13:10.790
I don't believe it! Are you rich or something?

00:13:10.790 --> 00:13:14.830
When making curry, you only use chikuwa, tofu and konyaku!

00:13:15.080 --> 00:13:17.540
I-Is that a money saving recipe?

00:13:17.790 --> 00:13:21.010
It's just unfair that you rich people want to use meat!

00:13:22.260 --> 00:13:24.590
I'll fight you with skill until the end!

00:13:24.970 --> 00:13:27.140
He's serious.

00:13:27.350 --> 00:13:28.350
This'll be tough.

00:13:28.350 --> 00:13:31.350
Is that so? Tough?

00:13:31.350 --> 00:13:33.100
I have nothing to do…

00:13:33.560 --> 00:13:34.350
Nii-san…

00:13:34.350 --> 00:13:37.770
It seems they've pretty much forgotten we're even here.

00:13:38.230 --> 00:13:40.530
It's better to be like this and not stand out.

00:13:44.240 --> 00:13:49.490
Well, they were all excellent curries, but which team will be the winner?

00:13:50.540 --> 00:13:54.710
Food samplers, please raise the winning number!

00:13:55.500 --> 00:13:59.590
Well, the one with the most raised… team 2!

00:13:59.590 --> 00:14:02.260
The winners are the Hanazono and Kujyou pair!

00:14:03.130 --> 00:14:04.340
Yeah!

00:14:04.340 --> 00:14:06.380
It's all because of the meat!

00:14:06.380 --> 00:14:09.850
It's because they used meat, dammit!

00:14:10.350 --> 00:14:13.850
The two of them win the hot spring trip!

00:14:15.180 --> 00:14:17.310
We weren't supposed to win.

00:14:18.020 --> 00:14:18.860
Sorry.

00:14:19.480 --> 00:14:21.770
Well then, second place goes to…

00:14:22.150 --> 00:14:23.030
Good.

00:14:24.320 --> 00:14:26.110
It's all because of the meat!

00:14:29.700 --> 00:14:32.080
In the end, we didn't get the ring…

00:14:32.080 --> 00:14:33.620
and we came third in the cooking challenge.

00:14:33.910 --> 00:14:35.620
What did we come here for?

00:14:37.790 --> 00:14:40.590
Please don't laugh whilst you're staring at a swimsuit.

00:14:41.250 --> 00:14:43.670
Kirika, don't you still understand?

00:14:45.130 --> 00:14:48.590
The fact that we got the swimsuit means,…

00:14:48.590 --> 00:14:53.260
we've got exactly what the amateur goddess, who currently has no swimsuit, wants.

00:14:55.270 --> 00:14:57.350
We'll use this, and this time…

00:15:01.440 --> 00:15:06.490
Please don't laugh so loudly while holding swimsuits in both hands, nii-san.

00:15:12.240 --> 00:15:15.200
It can't be helped, how long are you going to be depressed?

00:15:15.540 --> 00:15:17.410
That's because…

00:15:18.790 --> 00:15:22.750
Even though it was my first time with everyone here at the sea…

00:15:36.470 --> 00:15:37.390
Hey, Karin.

00:15:38.890 --> 00:15:42.940
"There is a really nice swimsuit, come get it at the marked location."

00:15:43.570 --> 00:15:45.280
This is…

00:15:45.280 --> 00:15:47.820
It much be from the culprits who stole your swimsuit.

00:15:49.320 --> 00:15:50.610
What are you going to do?

00:15:51.320 --> 00:15:52.410
I'm going.

00:15:52.780 --> 00:15:55.450
You wait with Nishikiyori at the house.

00:15:56.790 --> 00:15:58.750
Why?

00:15:58.750 --> 00:16:01.170
Karasuma showed up this morning, right?

00:16:01.620 --> 00:16:04.040
I beat him out at sea…

00:16:04.040 --> 00:16:07.760
so I think it'll be alright, but it's just to be sure, okay?

00:16:07.960 --> 00:16:10.170
I get it.

00:16:20.140 --> 00:16:21.350
It's just the wind.

00:16:22.810 --> 00:16:25.190
The sea is scary at night.

00:16:25.520 --> 00:16:29.570
That's why I told you to stay at the house with the rest.

00:16:30.030 --> 00:16:34.030
Well, we can't really rely on your disguise.

00:16:34.570 --> 00:16:35.490
Leave me alone.

00:16:35.870 --> 00:16:39.790
Besides, I have to hit one of the culprits, or else I won't be satisfied.

00:16:39.910 --> 00:16:44.500
You know, if you yourself are coming, then what's the point in my disguise?

00:16:46.540 --> 00:16:47.420
They're here.

00:16:47.710 --> 00:16:53.050
We will scare the amateur goddess with a ghost, and take that opportunity so steal the ring.

00:16:53.050 --> 00:16:54.550
Kirika, are you ready?

00:16:54.970 --> 00:16:56.010
All is okay.

00:16:57.430 --> 00:17:01.730
I get the feeling you're not really into this-

00:17:02.100 --> 00:17:05.360
It's mean of you to get so scared.

00:17:06.980 --> 00:17:08.610
Well, get into position.

00:17:13.280 --> 00:17:15.280
He's really scary.

00:17:15.700 --> 00:17:17.830
If I looked at him without notice I think I'd faint.

00:17:20.540 --> 00:17:22.460
Stop clinging to me!

00:17:22.460 --> 00:17:24.170
But, but!

00:17:24.170 --> 00:17:26.210
This isn't a test of courage!

00:17:28.710 --> 00:17:30.670
Good, trap number one:

00:17:31.210 --> 00:17:32.670
Nightmare Konyaku!

00:17:35.300 --> 00:17:35.970
Karin!

00:17:36.180 --> 00:17:39.180
Trap number two: Extending Round Torch.

00:17:44.890 --> 00:17:46.190
Karin, are you okay?

00:17:46.600 --> 00:17:49.650
Geez, what is this?

00:17:51.070 --> 00:17:52.110
G-Give it here.

00:17:56.950 --> 00:17:58.160
What is it?

00:17:58.160 --> 00:17:59.030
We're running for it.

00:17:59.700 --> 00:18:01.540
No!!!

00:18:05.000 --> 00:18:06.540
It has started.

00:18:07.330 --> 00:18:11.550
If this keeps up, I just need to lure the girls into this.

00:18:13.550 --> 00:18:15.260
I'm sorry, Karin-chan.

00:18:15.260 --> 00:18:17.550
I don't want to do this.

00:18:19.350 --> 00:18:19.970
They're here.

00:18:20.510 --> 00:18:23.060
Go away! Go away!

00:18:23.270 --> 00:18:23.770
Too bright!

00:18:29.610 --> 00:18:30.730
Did we get them?

00:18:32.320 --> 00:18:33.320
Did we succeed?

00:18:33.900 --> 00:18:34.400
Kirika?

00:18:34.940 --> 00:18:36.030
Kirika!?

00:18:39.410 --> 00:18:41.660
Nii-san… save me!

00:18:41.660 --> 00:18:44.580
Nii-san… save me!

00:18:44.910 --> 00:18:47.670
A demon came out!

00:18:50.630 --> 00:18:51.460
Nii-san…

00:18:53.460 --> 00:18:56.470
Wait a minute, Kazune-kun.

00:18:59.470 --> 00:19:01.850
Wait a minute.

00:19:03.390 --> 00:19:06.520
Huh? Kazune-kun?

00:19:09.980 --> 00:19:12.480
Kazune-kun!..

00:19:15.190 --> 00:19:17.990
Go away! What is this?!

00:19:19.280 --> 00:19:19.860
Huh?

00:19:21.070 --> 00:19:22.240
The batteries are dead.

00:19:23.700 --> 00:19:24.370
Karin?

00:19:24.910 --> 00:19:25.790
Karin!

00:19:26.450 --> 00:19:27.330
Karin!!

00:19:33.710 --> 00:19:36.170
Where is this?

00:19:36.920 --> 00:19:38.630
Hey!..

00:19:49.890 --> 00:19:51.730
Kazune-kun.

00:19:54.940 --> 00:19:56.900
Kazune-kun!

00:20:00.450 --> 00:20:00.860
Karin!

00:20:02.700 --> 00:20:03.450
Are you okay?

00:20:05.450 --> 00:20:06.620
Thank goodness.

00:20:08.450 --> 00:20:09.710
Kazune-kun.

00:20:18.420 --> 00:20:20.550
I'm sorry I left you alone.

00:20:22.640 --> 00:20:24.100
Kazune-kun.

00:20:24.760 --> 00:20:25.430
I'm sorry.

00:20:31.770 --> 00:20:37.320
Man, we feel down and didn't get the swimsuit, this is the worst!

00:20:38.360 --> 00:20:43.700
But, the Kazune-kun back then sure was kind.

00:20:48.080 --> 00:20:50.580
Karin-chan!

00:20:51.160 --> 00:20:53.290
Hanazono-san!

00:20:53.750 --> 00:20:55.750
Himeka-chan, Micchi!

00:20:55.750 --> 00:20:57.750
I told you to stay in the vacation house.

00:20:58.050 --> 00:21:00.760
How was it? What about the swimsuit, what about the culprits?

00:21:03.970 --> 00:21:06.010
Karin-chan.

00:21:07.430 --> 00:21:08.890
Ta-da!

00:21:09.600 --> 00:21:11.730
Cheer up.

00:21:13.690 --> 00:21:15.190
Fireworks!

00:21:19.730 --> 00:21:21.400
It's pretty.

00:21:22.570 --> 00:21:26.820
It sure gives you that summer feeling, doesn't it?

00:21:27.200 --> 00:21:30.750
Anyway, you sure look good like a girl, Kazune-kun.

00:21:31.000 --> 00:21:31.700
Huh?

00:21:32.210 --> 00:21:32.620
See?

00:21:34.420 --> 00:21:34.960
Shut up!

00:21:42.840 --> 00:21:45.260
We let our guard down. We'll get them next time.

00:21:46.180 --> 00:21:48.180
Let's just stop now, nii-san.

00:21:48.180 --> 00:21:51.180
Kirika, why are you always like that?

00:21:51.520 --> 00:21:52.140
Just take a look.

00:21:53.270 --> 00:21:56.940
Everyone's making fun summer memories.

00:21:57.400 --> 00:22:03.110
If we have the time to crush those, we should use it to make fun memories with our Himeka.

00:22:11.620 --> 00:22:12.620
Nii-san…

00:22:13.580 --> 00:22:15.790
We're going to buy some fireworks and go home.

00:22:16.580 --> 00:22:17.460
Okay.

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:45.530
Saa, ikou yo shiranai michi

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:45.530
Come, let's go down an unknown path.

00:22:46.320 --> 00:22:53.700
Sugu kieru mayotetteta

00:22:46.320 --> 00:22:53.700
It will soon dissappear, and we'll be lost.

00:22:54.830 --> 00:23:01.540
Hamikaze  sasotte

00:22:54.830 --> 00:23:01.540
Invited by the humming wind…

00:23:01.840 --> 00:23:09.050
Sasayaku kuchi no hou ikutte uta

00:23:01.840 --> 00:23:09.050
…that whispered out of my singing mouth.

00:23:09.050 --> 00:23:16.270
Sagashiteta mirai soba ni aru

00:23:09.050 --> 00:23:16.270
The future you're looking for is right next to you.

00:23:16.680 --> 00:23:23.260
Messeeji wa hitotsu kasanaru yo

00:23:16.680 --> 00:23:23.260
The messages are all piling up, one by one.

00:23:24.530 --> 00:23:32.830
Sora e kabatte tobashite yume o kabatte sakebu yo

00:23:24.530 --> 00:23:32.830
I'm going to fly up, protected into the sky and shout my dreams out to the world.

00:23:32.830 --> 00:23:41.380
Kimi ni todoke nanairo no michi tokuchuu meeru

00:23:32.830 --> 00:23:41.380
So that it'll reach you, my special delivery mail along a rainbow-coloured road.

00:23:41.580 --> 00:23:49.380
Hakanai negai demo isshunkai hanatto yo

00:23:41.580 --> 00:23:49.380
I won't abandon my fleeting wish, even for a second.

00:23:49.380 --> 00:24:03.050
Kimi ni todoke kono omoi to kimi ni fuiteta kaze wo

00:23:49.380 --> 00:24:03.050
So that my feelings will reach you, through this blowing wind.

00:24:05.320 --> 00:24:09.670
Summer Time Blues

00:24:06.030 --> 00:24:07.490
Next time on Kami-chama Karin:

00:24:07.490 --> 00:24:09.820
Summer time blues!

00:24:09.990 --> 00:24:13.070
An outdoor school, it seems like glasses guy is really interested in it.

00:24:13.070 --> 00:24:16.490
"In a survival race you must call out your love", what's with that?!

00:24:16.490 --> 00:24:19.460
The student council president's freshwater eel!?
